<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>iamatomiccc</Major>
    <Description>(screen resolution 1024 x 768 windowed mode )

auto scope in sniper rifle when the enemy is in range.

you can bind it only in your right click or side buttons (extra mouse buttons)
but always take note to be ready to pull the triger when the scope is triggered
keep in mind to only click the designated mouse key "once" to not be confused</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>GoColor 3 2 255,0,0 255,15,15 2 600 220 220 400 1 0
Goto 1
RightDown 1
Delay 30 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 20 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>